 end="00:50.730">I'm </span><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:51.390">ready </span><span begin="00:51.390" end="00:52.370">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.800" end="00:54.240"><span begin="00:52.800" end="00:53.050">Why </span><span begin="00:53.050" end="00:53.180">you </span><span begin="00:53.180" end="00:53.540">gotta </span><span begin="00:53.540" end="00:53.900">do </span><span begin="00:53.900" end="00:54.240">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.240" end="00:54.550"><span begin="00:54.240" end="00:54.550">Why</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.630" end="00:57.400"><span begin="00:55.630" end="00:55.950">You're </span><span begin="00:55.950" end="00:56.090">the </span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.320">one </span><span begin="00:56.320" end="00:56.440">who </span><span begin="00:56.440" end="00:56.810">blew </span><span begin="00:56.810" end="00:57.400">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.580" end="01:00.320"><span begin="00:58.580" end="00:58.920">Every </span><span begin="00:58.920" end="00:59.230">time </span><span begin="00:59.230" end="00:59.310">you </span><span begin="00:59.310" end="00:59.800">come </span><span begin="00:59.800" end="01:00.010">you </span><span begin="01:00.010" end="01:00.320">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.720" end="01:02.470"><span begin="01:00.720" end="01:01.110">Every </span><span begin="01:01.110" end="01:01.380">time </span><span begin="01:01.380" end="01:01.460">you </span><span begin="01:01.460" end="01:02.010">come </span><span begin="01:02.010" end="01:02.200">you </span><span begin="01:02.200" end="01:02.470">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.580" end="01:05.980"><span begin="01:03.580" end="01:03.870">Call </span><span begin="01:03.870" end="01:04.080">me </span><span begin="01:04.080" end="01:04.260">up </span><span begin="01:04.260" end="01:04.360">to </span><span begin="01:04.360" end="01:04.810">comfort </span><span begin="01:04.810" end="01:04.970">you 